PicoCAD2 - Simple low-poly 3d model maker, texture maker, spritesheet maker, animator, etc.

Links:
-Website: https://picocad.net
-Steam: https://store.steampowered.com/app/3675940/picoCAD_2/
-Itch.io: https://johanpeitz.itch.io/picocad2

Pros:
-Cheap ($14.95 currently)
-Great for low-poly models
-Offers a variety of simple tools and exports (OBJ, GLTF, and GIF exports for example)
-Beginner friendly
-Contains official documentation as well as a discord server
-Simple and fun UI

Cons:
-Beta versions are only available on Steam
-Unable to export animations
